				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody"><span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-weight: bold">The Council of Four</span></span>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Chancellor - Jelen the Warden</span>
<br />
Representing the Dia Luxa's role as guildmaster on Earth. Will assist in the organization of the council and maintaining the stability of our framework.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Dia Sepia - Khya the Druid</span>
<br />
Our public relations officer. A connection to the rest of our realm.  Also assists the Armpala with active recruitment.  
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Dia Armpala - Faros the Eldritch</span>
<br />
In charge of recruitment and answering questions about membership. 
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Dia Chixom - Kesslyn the Ranger</span>
<br />
Originally created for the aquisition of items for our guild. The Chixom shall take on many important roles in our Realm vs. Realm combat. The Chixom may be thought of as the general of our army. He will investigate strategies and tactics as well as research potential hunting spots / dungeon crawls / large scale events and undertake the responsibility of organizing them.
<br />
Il-Khan Chixom: <span style="font-style: italic">Kiven McCann</span>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Dia Bakkus - Artaril the Mentalist</span>
<br />
The Dia Bakkus will act as our treasurer as well as assist in roster organization.
<br />

<br />
The council shall be the only members who possess officer status. Which so far, simply entails the ability to invite others into the guild. The following titles will represent the rest of our guild.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Il-Khan</span>
<br />
Should any upon our council feel they need an assistant they may select an Il-Khan as their apprentice to train in their every day tasks and assist with errands.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Imperator</span>
<br />
As our guild develops and fills out more and our classes become slightly more saturated we will leave it to the members of that class to elect an Imperator to guide them in their path, much as our process entailed in Norrath. 
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Privatus</span>
<br />
Standard member of Evoluxa
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Initiate</span>
<br />
New recruit .. the method of promotion from Initiate to Privatus has not been discussed yet. A candidate will have to have full approval from the Dia Armpala before becoming an Initiate. Once guilded the process from Initiate to Privatus will begin. This will need to be discussed.
<br />

<br />
FYI - a quick breakdown of the internal rank/title structure in Evoluxa. The ranks are titled as listed and all settings seem to be operating correctly.
<br />

<br />
0 - Chancellor 
<br />
1 - Dia Armpala 
<br />
2 - Dia Sepia 
<br />
3 - Dia Chixom 
<br />
4 - Dia Bakkus 
<br />
** Officer cutoff **
<br />
5 - Il-Khan 
<br />
6 - Imperator
<br />
7 - Privatus
<br />
9 - Initiate
<br />

<br />
The duties listed above are just a general outline.  All officers play a responsibility and authority in any field and any officer may be approached for any situation.  They will be happy to channel it through the appropriate means.</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
